<title>USA: TABLE - Goody's July same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Goody's July same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goody's Family Clothing Inc Thursday reported sales for the month of July, and its second quarter and first half.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$60.8	$51.4     +18.3	 +8.4</p>
<p>Second Qtr	$212.2     $183.4     +15.7	 +7.3</p>
<p>First Half	$402.3     $334.2     +20.4	+10.9</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
